WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.660
Managers and admins can move a ticket up one level in the Escalation Ladder.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.480
Check the current rung and the role above it before choosing Escalate.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.360
Explain why the current owner needs help, then confirm the move.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.400
Expand History and check the new level and reason.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.855
This is a recorded handoff, not a substitute for describing the underlying fault.
